=Nour=
(WeTV Original)

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.770
Why did you save me?

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.540
You don't need to know.

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.540
What...

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.020
