well, you better take care♪

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.680
Wasn't this your favorite record?

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.930
You'd never play it for just anyone.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:10.960
I'm dying.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.420
Don't joke about that.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.480
It's late-stage cancer.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.820
The doctor says I have

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:25.340
three months, tops.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.580
I'm going to...

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.290
die.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:37.970
Hey, everyone!

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.820
Listen to me.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.280
I have cancer.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:51.340
I'm dying.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.340
So tonight,

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.720
it's all on me. Let's party!

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.890
Here we go! Woohoo! Cheers!

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.420
Woohoo!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.580
Come on. Cheers!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.100
Cheers!

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.490
Cheers!

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:22.560
Why aren't you dancing?

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.130
Mm.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:26.970
Hey.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.450
Look at all this life around us.

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.020
People come and go.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:35.970
They dance like it's their last night.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.130
Why look so lifeless?

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.780
Even if you can't get drunk,

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:46.050
you can still taste the wine, right?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.570
Here.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.290
Have a drink with me.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.680
To what little life I have left.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.370
Live well for me when I'm gone.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.020
And let yourself be happy.

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.300
For an old man on death's door,

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.690
I've already escaped death once.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:01.440
Who knew

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.840
I'd live another decade or more?

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.920
I've watched people dance

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.760
and seen the times change.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.500
I have no regrets.

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.530
There's just one thing left.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:34.880
Before I close my eyes,

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.880
I want to see you

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:42.050
living a happy life.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.520
What's the point of living so long

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:53.140
if you've never tried

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.960
to truly live?

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.680
Even though...

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.290
I knew all along

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:30.600
human lives are short...

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.180
Why...

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:45.450
didn't I drink with you more often?

00:07:57.260 --> 00:08:09.400
=Episode 6=
(Melody in Shadow)

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:25.970
You're awake.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.240
You've only been asleep a few hours.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.410
I wasn't sleeping.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.500
Were you watching me sleep?

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.940
Nours don't need sleep.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.280
You may not need sleep,

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.050
but if you want to,

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.340
you can sleep, right?

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:53.780
I can.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:55.730
I just don't see why I should.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:08:57.610
Even if I sleep,

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.130
my body never truly shuts down.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.450
Even while asleep,

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.760
my nervous system stays fully active.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.170
Want to hold me while you sleep?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.520
I think

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.210
sleeping with me in your arms

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.450
would feel much better.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.280
Go back and report in.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.170
Mm.

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.500
Right.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.180
Inspector.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.700
I've come up with a great plan.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.160
I'll find the culprit soon,

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.380
and whoever killed my dad,

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.660
because I can't wait

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:44.500
to start living with you.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:51.760
Well?

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.210
Great plan, right?

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:01.720
Hey, you.

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.940
You haven't answered. Good plan?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.180
Ahem.

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:14.690
What are you looking for?

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.400
- Huh?
- Want me to find it?

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.400
No need.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:20.400
Go back to work.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.010
What is it?

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:27.510
Hungry?

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:28.660
I'll make you something.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.420
How old are these noodles?

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:56.210
Uh...

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.370
A few years.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.580
Did you flip the switch?

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:06.880
The switch?

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.940
This?

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:11.600
Mm.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.170
I already did.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.380
But you haven't added any water.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.200
I have to add water?

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:37.800
Mm.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.060
Add water before turning it on.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.290
So all this time,

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:49.120
you've lived on blood?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:50.960
Mm.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:54.100
My body can't handle regular food.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.680
Anything I eat comes right back up.

00:12:57.900 --> 00:12:58.680
Mm.

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.200
That's a shame.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.410
I think

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.610
eating something delicious

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.400
is one of life's greatest joys.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:13.930
Mm. It's ready.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.800
Careful, it's hot.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:20.800
I'm a Nour.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:23.900
I forgot.

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:27.280
Mm.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.010
Careful. It's hot.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.640
I know, I know.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.680
I gave you a bowl. Why not use it?

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:42.490
I'll eat it like this.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:43.940
Fewer dishes to wash.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:44.770
Less work.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.010
Let's see

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.570
what Grandpa's noodles

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.340
taste like.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.160
Mm.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:58.160
Too hot?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.880
They're already rancid.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.200
When did you buy these?

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.460
(Instant Noodles)

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:15.370
Try another bite.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.000
Does it stink?

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:46.690
Then don't.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.500
It doesn't stink anymore.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.200
Oh.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.570
- Stop eating it.
- Wait a second.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.170
The best noodles I've ever had.

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:57.060
Let me keep eating.

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.060
Doesn't it stink anymore?

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.120
I'm serious.

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:10.140
Who else gets to eat noodles this old
these days?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.140
If I didn't know you,

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.530
I'd never get to try this.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:33.760
(POLICE)

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:39.890
You go first.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:41.660
I said, you go first.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:43.660
Go ahead.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:47.040
Thanks.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.360
Now you're as messy as I am.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.400
Come here.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:18.220
You ordered my transfer, didn't you?

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:19.460
Why?

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.120
It's for the best.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.560
How is this for the best?

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:24.340
Get out.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.800
What are you doing?

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.410
Keep it safe.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.770
It's as old as the noodles
you ate this morning.

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.080
Yes, sir.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.200
Speaking of which,

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.440
you came to see me first.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.640
Doesn't that break the rules?

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:41.820
James.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:42.720
Little Roach.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:49.420
You have Tee's phone

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:50.600
in evidence, right?

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.400
What are you doing here?

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.090
I came all this way

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.520
because you're so unreliable, Inspector.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:05.700
Hello.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.580
I'm Police Lieutenant Phakin Woraphakdi.

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:10.050
The Special Investigation Unit

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:11.610
sent me here

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.740
to replace Inspector James.

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:17.540
Yours, right?

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:20.970
Hey, you!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.160
This is my desk.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:26.530
Also,

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.560
hand over all evidence and case files.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.460
But Inspector Ken and I are handling
this case.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:37.610
James.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:39.610
You...

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:40.850
should go back and rest.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.480
Just follow your superiors' orders.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:44.840
That's all.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:47.530
Everyone back there

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.760
must really miss you.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.170
Don't get cocky.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.610
Don't make me report you.

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:04.060
I have to do my job.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:10.860
Take it.

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:13.080
I'd like to see

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.080
what you can uncover.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.170
Thank you.

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:56.900
The arm is deformed.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.000
Open head wound.

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:05.450
Likely caused by a fall from a height.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.450
Please take measurements and photos.

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.940
If you tell anyone about this...

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:18.600
Ow!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.050
I'll make sure you can't work here.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:22.770
Thanks.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:23.810
(Happy Valentine's Day)

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:41.850
Chita.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:45.370
Ow!

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:56.250
What's wrong, Chita?

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.000
You seem distracted.

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:02.360
Are you feeling sick?

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:20.840
Nothing's wrong.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:23.480
Mm.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.700
Please take a photo.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.130
Hello.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:42.460
(Hello, I'm Police Lieutenant
Phakin Woraphakdi.)

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:43.950
(I'll be direct.)

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:47.170
(Do you think the killer
is human or a Nour?)

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.860
(Or is there anyone you suspect?)

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:52.710
(Based on the evidence gathered so far,)

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:55.960
I think we need to wait

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:58.480
until Inspectors Ken and James
question the witnesses

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.560
before we know for sure.

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:01.750
(Do you know Prae well?)

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:05.890
Prae?

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:08.920
The medical technology intern?

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:12.080
(Prae seems suspicious to me.)

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:13.800
(Could you contact her for me?)

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:15.860
(Ask her to meet me after work.)

00:22:30.900 --> 00:22:31.500
Chita.

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:37.640
Are you scared?

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:40.410
Mm.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.080
I'm worried about you.

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:49.690
I heard Prae may be interrogated

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:52.780
because she seems suspicious.

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:56.760
Either way, I want you to stay safe.

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:00.680
I don't want you to trust anyone.

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:06.020
Okay.

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:08.020
I'll be careful.

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:10.200
And I won't trust anyone.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.840
But I can trust you, right?

00:23:21.490 --> 00:23:22.560
No matter what,

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:26.000
I want you to stay out of this.

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:28.170
Stay away from Prae.

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:30.460
Please trust me.

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:35.450
Maybe...

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:38.400
we should move somewhere else.

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:42.250
Please trust me.

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:44.770
We'll be okay.

00:23:48.460 --> 00:23:49.690
We'll be safe.

00:24:06.320 --> 00:24:08.170
Doctor, let's

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:10.960
get back to work.

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:14.380
Mm.

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:21.770
Keep taking photos.

00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:24.410
Okay.

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:30.370
Okay. Take photos.

00:24:50.840 --> 00:24:51.690
Hey, Inspector.

00:24:51.920 --> 00:24:52.880
Why'd you call me?

00:24:53.020 --> 00:24:53.780
What's going on?

00:24:58.080 --> 00:24:58.960
Take off your clothes.

00:24:59.660 --> 00:25:00.560
What?

00:25:01.480 --> 00:25:02.680
- Your clothes.
- What'd you say?

00:25:02.730 --> 00:25:03.820
Take off your clothes.

00:25:08.110 --> 00:25:09.050
Shoes too.

00:25:09.570 --> 00:25:10.600
My shoes too?

00:25:11.640 --> 00:25:13.160
What are you planning to do with me?

00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:16.840
Come on. I'm ready.

00:25:20.200 --> 00:25:22.100
I'm going to teach you
how to catch a Nour.

00:25:22.700 --> 00:25:23.410
First,

00:25:24.440 --> 00:25:25.410
trust your instincts.

00:25:27.340 --> 00:25:29.130
Nours see well in the dark.

00:25:30.840 --> 00:25:32.880
Watch out for attacks from blind spots.

00:25:33.600 --> 00:25:34.360
Ow!

00:25:34.580 --> 00:25:35.840
Inspector, what are you doing?

00:25:36.010 --> 00:25:37.370
Focus.

00:25:37.880 --> 00:25:39.220
Breathe slowly.

00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:41.530
Focus your vision.

00:25:47.600 --> 00:25:49.250
Were you standing here the whole time?

00:25:56.980 --> 00:25:58.160
Aim here.

00:26:07.530 --> 00:26:09.080
Around the joints.

00:26:11.360 --> 00:26:12.970
These parts of a Nour's body

00:26:17.330 --> 00:26:19.050
heal more slowly.

00:26:30.320 --> 00:26:31.450
Your turn.

00:26:34.450 --> 00:26:35.600
You want me to stab you?

00:26:36.610 --> 00:26:37.080
Yes.

00:26:37.900 --> 00:26:38.820
Are you crazy?

00:26:42.980 --> 00:26:43.690
Guard up.

00:26:53.290 --> 00:26:54.780
A real Nour would've killed you.

00:26:56.010 --> 00:26:56.930
Time to get serious.

00:27:06.240 --> 00:27:07.720
Nours are stronger than humans.

00:27:08.120 --> 00:27:09.400
You can't rely on brute force.

00:27:12.340 --> 00:27:13.720
Brute force won't work?

00:27:17.850 --> 00:27:18.660
What if...

00:27:28.110 --> 00:27:29.620
I do this?

00:27:39.860 --> 00:27:40.580
Sorry.

00:27:44.130 --> 00:27:45.770
I shouldn't have requested
your transfer.

00:27:56.180 --> 00:27:57.040
It's okay.

00:27:57.610 --> 00:27:58.920
I know you were...

00:28:00.213 --> 00:28:01.040
Stay alert.

00:28:11.450 --> 00:28:12.480
That was dirty!

00:28:12.700 --> 00:28:14.060
I almost won!

00:28:14.880 --> 00:28:16.570
Why do you keep messing
with my feelings?

00:28:20.080 --> 00:28:20.760
Ugh.

00:28:23.340 --> 00:28:24.570
I'm beat, Inspector.

00:28:24.800 --> 00:28:26.000
Let me rest, okay?

00:28:26.420 --> 00:28:27.440
Get up.

00:28:27.840 --> 00:28:30.060
No! Let me rest.

00:28:30.610 --> 00:28:31.420
I'm starving.

00:28:38.900 --> 00:28:40.040
Where are you going?

00:28:51.760 --> 00:28:52.330
For me?

00:28:52.770 --> 00:28:53.180
Mm.

00:29:01.380 --> 00:29:02.890
Let's see.

00:29:11.160 --> 00:29:12.260
Not rancid this time.

00:29:12.560 --> 00:29:13.170
Eating or not?

00:29:13.170 --> 00:29:15.490
Yes, I'm eating!

00:29:16.820 --> 00:29:18.080
You added eggs too.

00:29:18.410 --> 00:29:19.330
Two of them.

00:29:20.140 --> 00:29:21.180
It's the deluxe version.

00:29:22.280 --> 00:29:25.080
This is my first real attempt at cooking
in over a century.

00:29:32.530 --> 00:29:34.100
There's something I've always wondered.

00:29:34.970 --> 00:29:35.680
Can I ask?

00:29:37.120 --> 00:29:37.600
Mm.

00:29:38.840 --> 00:29:40.880
Am I the first to know you're a Nour?

00:29:43.660 --> 00:29:44.850
Mm.

00:29:47.650 --> 00:29:48.440
Let's go upstairs.

00:29:48.660 --> 00:29:49.760
Hey, wait.

00:29:49.920 --> 00:29:50.720
Hey!

00:29:51.050 --> 00:29:52.360
Who else knows besides me?

00:29:52.820 --> 00:29:54.360
Mom!

00:29:55.050 --> 00:29:57.060
Mom!

00:29:57.450 --> 00:29:58.290
Ah!

00:30:00.570 --> 00:30:02.570
Mom!

00:30:03.770 --> 00:30:04.330
Mom!

00:30:04.800 --> 00:30:05.170
Mom!

00:30:08.950 --> 00:30:11.300
Mom! Mom! Mom!

00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:23.420
Stop the bleeding!

00:30:24.920 --> 00:30:26.040
Aren't you a doctor?

00:30:26.680 --> 00:30:27.410
Stop the bleeding!

00:30:31.250 --> 00:30:32.780
Stop the bleeding, now!

00:30:34.220 --> 00:30:35.530
Stop the bleeding!

00:30:36.360 --> 00:30:37.780
Stop the bleeding! Mom! Mom!

00:30:37.780 --> 00:30:38.400
Mom!

00:30:48.010 --> 00:30:49.050
Keep her awake.

00:30:50.520 --> 00:30:51.050
Hurry!

00:31:00.440 --> 00:31:01.040
Mom!

00:31:01.130 --> 00:31:01.860
Mom!

00:31:01.860 --> 00:31:03.130
Mom, don't fall asleep!

00:31:03.130 --> 00:31:03.850
Mom!

00:31:05.040 --> 00:31:05.930
From that day on,

00:31:07.050 --> 00:31:08.930
Dr. Jirat's mother was left
permanently disabled.

00:31:10.480 --> 00:31:12.860
Dr. Ji became a forensic assistant

00:31:13.980 --> 00:31:16.080
and later a forensic pathologist.

00:31:17.180 --> 00:31:18.660
So all these years,

00:31:19.330 --> 00:31:22.650
Dr. Ji's been hiding that you're a Nour?

00:31:29.580 --> 00:31:30.200
I see.

00:31:34.520 --> 00:31:35.300
What's wrong?

00:31:37.780 --> 00:31:38.920
I'm just a little annoyed.

00:31:39.780 --> 00:31:42.280
I can't believe I wasn't the first
to find out you're a Nour.

00:31:51.120 --> 00:31:52.170
This lamp is beautiful.

00:31:53.940 --> 00:31:55.370
You have good taste.

00:32:03.570 --> 00:32:04.500
All right.

00:32:04.640 --> 00:32:05.690
Back to training.

00:32:06.380 --> 00:32:08.170
Come on, let me rest.

00:32:09.810 --> 00:32:10.940
Let's see

00:32:11.050 --> 00:32:13.290
what else you've got around here.

00:32:20.000 --> 00:32:21.050
A record player?

00:32:22.780 --> 00:32:23.730
Can I take a look?

00:32:30.520 --> 00:32:31.280
Whoa.

00:32:32.140 --> 00:32:33.770
Why are all these records so old?

00:32:38.010 --> 00:32:38.960
An Elvis record.

00:32:40.060 --> 00:32:40.960
What year is it from?

00:32:42.280 --> 00:32:42.960
Wait.

00:32:43.690 --> 00:32:44.660
It's signed.

00:32:45.520 --> 00:32:46.660
Where did you get this?

00:32:48.700 --> 00:32:49.360
So cool.

00:32:51.890 --> 00:32:52.970
This one's signed too.

00:32:55.840 --> 00:32:57.090
Can I play this one?

00:33:17.240 --> 00:33:18.420
Once the music starts,

00:33:19.180 --> 00:33:21.010
the room finally feels alive.

00:33:22.680 --> 00:33:23.340
Like it?

00:33:23.340 --> 00:33:26.520
♪Waiting here♪

00:33:30.880 --> 00:33:33.940
♪Why did you go♪

00:33:34.250 --> 00:33:37.400
♪Where is the touch?♪

00:33:38.240 --> 00:33:39.060
Inspector Ken.

00:33:40.730 --> 00:33:43.690
♪Where is the love?♪

00:33:43.800 --> 00:33:45.460
May I have this dance?

00:34:02.980 --> 00:34:04.050
You ever danced before?

00:34:07.240 --> 00:34:08.140
Seriously?

00:34:08.930 --> 00:34:12.450
You don't eat, sleep, or even dance?

00:34:12.700 --> 00:34:13.740
How do you even live?

00:34:15.620 --> 00:34:16.640
Want to dance with me?

00:34:18.260 --> 00:34:19.320
You want me to?

00:34:19.640 --> 00:34:20.360
Mm.

00:34:21.570 --> 00:34:22.940
Stop calling me Inspector.

00:34:24.620 --> 00:34:25.480
Then...

00:34:25.660 --> 00:34:26.500
Uncle Ken?

00:34:27.450 --> 00:34:29.250
I'm over a century older than you.

00:34:30.220 --> 00:34:31.250
Then Uncle Ken it is.

00:34:34.440 --> 00:34:35.360
Just kidding.

00:34:37.080 --> 00:34:38.850
How about I call you...

00:34:41.720 --> 00:34:42.860
darling?

00:34:45.130 --> 00:34:45.620
How's that?

00:34:47.660 --> 00:34:48.860
That was a joke too.

00:34:50.090 --> 00:34:51.080
That's too cheesy.

00:34:53.210 --> 00:34:54.680
Mm.

00:34:57.770 --> 00:34:58.820
Then I think

00:34:59.770 --> 00:35:00.820
I'll just call you Ken.

00:35:03.020 --> 00:35:04.130
Just Ken.

00:35:05.580 --> 00:35:06.280
Is that okay?

00:35:09.170 --> 00:35:11.770
♪¿Por qué, mi amor?♪

00:35:12.000 --> 00:35:12.900
I'll take that as a yes.

00:35:12.900 --> 00:35:14.730
♪Why did you throw our love away?♪

00:35:14.730 --> 00:35:15.680
Come on.

00:35:16.133 --> 00:35:17.410
I'll teach you to dance.

00:35:20.250 --> 00:35:23.290
♪Where is hope?♪

00:35:23.290 --> 00:35:24.690
Just follow my lead.

00:35:24.690 --> 00:35:26.640
♪Touch♪

00:35:26.900 --> 00:35:32.120
♪Where is your tender love?♪

00:35:36.660 --> 00:35:42.480
♪You're my light,
you're shining so bright♪

00:35:42.500 --> 00:35:49.080
♪Here we are, in the world,
all alone♪

00:35:49.360 --> 00:35:56.040
♪It's getting late, but I will wait♪

00:35:56.050 --> 00:36:00.140
♪I will always wait for you♪

00:36:41.580 --> 00:36:43.280
(My only regret)

00:36:44.900 --> 00:36:46.290
(is that before I close my eyes,)

00:36:46.480 --> 00:36:49.240
(I won't get to see you
living a happy life.)

00:36:51.640 --> 00:36:53.400
(What's the point of living so long)

00:36:54.600 --> 00:36:58.010
(if you've never tried to truly live?)

00:36:58.730 --> 00:36:59.440
Ken.

00:37:00.800 --> 00:37:01.960
I'm right here.

00:37:32.280 --> 00:37:34.330
That means you've probably
been through a lot.

00:37:37.040 --> 00:37:38.210
You've already taught me

00:37:40.530 --> 00:37:42.660
what life is like as a Nour.

00:37:45.100 --> 00:37:46.020
From now on,

00:37:48.000 --> 00:37:49.080
I'll teach you

00:37:51.290 --> 00:37:53.050
to live like an ordinary person.

00:38:13.480 --> 00:38:14.610
What are you watching?

00:38:15.920 --> 00:38:17.170
Does this look normal to you?

00:38:19.080 --> 00:38:19.890
No.

00:38:19.890 --> 00:38:21.250
Of course not.

00:38:21.250 --> 00:38:23.410
What kind of weirdo watches
videos of two guys kissing?

00:38:24.480 --> 00:38:25.600
No, I mean...

00:38:26.330 --> 00:38:28.360
Is it normal for guy friends to kiss?

00:38:33.040 --> 00:38:34.740
My brother brought a friend over, right?

00:38:36.200 --> 00:38:37.660
When I went to check on them,

00:38:38.330 --> 00:38:39.960
I saw my brother kissing his friend.

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:41.960
Is that normal?

00:38:45.460 --> 00:38:47.600
Maybe they're more than friends.

00:38:49.120 --> 00:38:50.600
My brother's never dated a man.

00:38:57.000 --> 00:38:58.370
What if...

00:38:59.880 --> 00:39:01.170
they're a couple?

00:39:03.120 --> 00:39:04.860
What's wrong

00:39:05.600 --> 00:39:06.440
with two men kissing?

00:39:14.820 --> 00:39:16.220
I'm just worried about my brother.

00:39:18.100 --> 00:39:19.570
I don't want him dating anyone.

00:39:20.540 --> 00:39:22.810
I don't want him getting hurt again.

00:39:24.560 --> 00:39:25.700
Remember last time?

00:39:25.700 --> 00:39:26.900
If I hadn't arrived in time,

00:39:27.480 --> 00:39:28.650
my brother would've died.

00:39:35.160 --> 00:39:35.920
You...

00:39:37.240 --> 00:39:38.280
Calm down.

00:39:39.160 --> 00:39:41.370
They really might just be friends.

00:39:43.290 --> 00:39:44.450
What friends kiss like that?

00:40:20.140 --> 00:40:20.680
Darn!

00:40:20.940 --> 00:40:22.130
Can you forget what happened?

00:40:25.530 --> 00:40:26.610
I don't know why I did that.

00:40:32.200 --> 00:40:32.930
Um, I...

00:40:33.690 --> 00:40:34.650
If I made you uneasy,

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:36.460
I'm sorry.

00:40:38.700 --> 00:40:40.080
You're my only friend

00:40:40.760 --> 00:40:41.960
and my safe place.

00:40:44.970 --> 00:40:45.540
Well...

00:40:47.020 --> 00:40:48.880
I know

00:40:49.720 --> 00:40:51.080
my place in your life.

00:40:57.440 --> 00:40:59.760
I don't want one mistake to cost me you.

00:41:03.700 --> 00:41:04.440
I...

00:41:04.880 --> 00:41:05.660
I think...

00:41:08.370 --> 00:41:09.200
I think I...

00:41:09.580 --> 00:41:11.200
see you as more than a friend.

00:41:14.960 --> 00:41:16.020
I don't know

00:41:17.050 --> 00:41:18.300
what that feeling was.

00:41:20.810 --> 00:41:22.060
Maybe I feel the same way.

00:41:24.620 --> 00:41:26.490
I'll admit I have feelings for you.

00:41:29.970 --> 00:41:31.200
But when I saw it was you,

00:41:31.260 --> 00:41:32.240
I got scared.

00:41:33.090 --> 00:41:34.730
Scared I'd really fall for you

00:41:35.920 --> 00:41:37.180
and lose you in the end.

00:41:38.010 --> 00:41:39.220
What would I do then?

00:41:46.100 --> 00:41:47.580
I want us to stay friends forever.

00:41:50.930 --> 00:41:52.020
Graduate together.

00:41:54.450 --> 00:41:55.580
Work near each other.

00:41:57.060 --> 00:41:58.130
Be there at your wedding.

00:42:00.160 --> 00:42:01.360
Play with your kids and stuff.

00:42:12.760 --> 00:42:13.500
I...

00:42:15.090 --> 00:42:16.130
I'm heading home.

00:42:16.130 --> 00:42:16.680
Uh.

00:42:40.680 --> 00:42:43.020
I can smell the rain.

00:42:44.170 --> 00:42:45.020
It looks like

00:42:45.400 --> 00:42:46.680
it's going to rain.

00:42:53.770 --> 00:42:54.860
Mm.

00:42:56.650 --> 00:42:57.530
It really does.

00:42:57.530 --> 00:42:58.530
Those look like rain clouds.

00:43:05.010 --> 00:43:05.520
Chita.

00:43:06.250 --> 00:43:06.800
I think

00:43:07.040 --> 00:43:08.800
it's raining. Let's go.

00:43:12.800 --> 00:43:13.530
Ow.

00:43:14.040 --> 00:43:14.720
Chita.

00:43:15.290 --> 00:43:16.720
- Sorry.
- No, thanks.

00:43:18.690 --> 00:43:19.720
I can manage.

00:43:22.520 --> 00:43:23.330
Then...

00:43:25.760 --> 00:43:26.760
we can hold hands.

00:43:35.640 --> 00:43:36.210
Careful.

00:43:47.560 --> 00:43:48.250
What's wrong?

00:43:57.460 --> 00:43:59.520
I want to walk beside you on my own.

00:44:03.220 --> 00:44:04.570
I also don't want you to think

00:44:06.180 --> 00:44:08.700
that because of my legs,
I can't walk beside you.

00:44:20.860 --> 00:44:21.580
Chita.

00:44:24.300 --> 00:44:26.090
I've never thought you were flawed.

00:44:28.600 --> 00:44:29.740
Let's walk together.

00:45:25.130 --> 00:45:26.560
No, it's okay, Doctor.

00:45:38.370 --> 00:45:39.450
Have a seat.

00:45:40.260 --> 00:45:41.450
I'll get you some water.

00:45:44.740 --> 00:45:45.490
No, thanks.

00:45:50.800 --> 00:45:51.970
Just sit with me for a while.

00:46:12.140 --> 00:46:13.970
Ever thought of living somewhere else?

00:46:21.780 --> 00:46:23.940
Since the attack left Mom disabled,

00:46:26.210 --> 00:46:27.780
I haven't wanted to live

00:46:27.780 --> 00:46:29.010
far from her or my family.

00:46:33.210 --> 00:46:34.530
I'm the opposite.

00:46:39.250 --> 00:46:40.760
I've always moved around

00:46:43.880 --> 00:46:45.240
and never truly settled down.

00:46:58.450 --> 00:46:59.960
But things are different now.

00:47:04.480 --> 00:47:05.720
Stay by my side.

00:47:08.040 --> 00:47:09.020
Stay here with me.

00:47:11.160 --> 00:47:12.480
You won't have to move again.

00:48:31.450 --> 00:48:34.530
Easy. Keep it down.
The neighbors will hear.

00:50:18.620 --> 00:50:19.460
Doctor.

00:50:20.960 --> 00:50:22.920
Doctor, didn't you say to keep it down?

00:50:37.450 --> 00:50:39.130
(POLICE)

00:50:43.210 --> 00:50:44.570
I've unlocked Tee's phone.

00:50:45.320 --> 00:50:47.700
The last message he got was from Prae.

00:50:47.700 --> 00:50:48.540
How could you?

00:50:49.010 --> 00:50:51.600
The Forensics Unit has to finish
examining Tee's phone

00:50:51.600 --> 00:50:52.940
before we can access its data.

00:50:55.280 --> 00:50:57.220
You used a shady hacker again,
just like before?

00:50:57.760 --> 00:50:59.010
Can't you do this by the book?

00:50:59.290 --> 00:51:00.650
Aren't you a cop?

00:51:01.890 --> 00:51:02.880
Listen up.

00:51:03.410 --> 00:51:05.020
I'd rather be a thief who gets results

00:51:05.260 --> 00:51:07.180
than a careless cop like you.

00:51:07.480 --> 00:51:08.520
What do you want?

00:51:08.660 --> 00:51:09.570
Enough.

00:51:11.040 --> 00:51:12.340
If Prae really is the killer,

00:51:12.340 --> 00:51:13.480
we're racing against time.

00:51:15.200 --> 00:51:15.980
Then come with me.

00:51:16.320 --> 00:51:17.440
You know where Prae is?

00:51:19.130 --> 00:51:20.250
Ever heard of tracking apps?

00:51:21.700 --> 00:51:22.820
What a hick.

00:51:40.900 --> 00:51:41.810
Darn!

00:51:41.810 --> 00:51:42.760
That's a Nour!

00:51:43.120 --> 00:51:44.610
Nour or not, I'll catch her myself.

00:51:46.000 --> 00:51:48.130
Peter, when will you stop
being so reckless?

00:51:58.410 --> 00:52:00.010
I'm with the Special Investigation Unit.

00:52:00.140 --> 00:52:01.850
Come with me to the station.

00:52:02.560 --> 00:52:04.260
Don't you need a summons first?

00:52:05.530 --> 00:52:06.780
If the killer is right here,

00:52:06.900 --> 00:52:08.570
I can arrest her on the spot.

00:52:11.360 --> 00:52:12.560
Aren't you holding me right now?

00:52:13.260 --> 00:52:13.850
Let go.

00:52:17.320 --> 00:52:18.520
I said, let go!

00:52:19.530 --> 00:52:20.320
Ah!

00:52:25.600 --> 00:52:26.700
Ken, go check on Peter.

00:52:27.930 --> 00:52:28.970
Go after her!

00:52:37.000 --> 00:52:37.760
Hey, you!

00:52:37.760 --> 00:52:39.360
Why aren't you checking on Peter?

00:52:39.360 --> 00:52:40.960
I'm a doctor. I checked him. He's fine.

00:52:42.240 --> 00:52:44.260
Hey! Wait for me!

00:52:44.770 --> 00:52:45.680
Ken!

00:52:56.050 --> 00:52:57.100
Did you kill Tee?

00:53:09.370 --> 00:53:10.930
I'd never kill him.

00:53:23.220 --> 00:53:24.900
Are you the Nour who can
kill other Nours?

00:53:24.900 --> 00:53:25.740
Want to know?

00:53:33.610 --> 00:53:34.610
If I get out,

00:53:35.930 --> 00:53:37.020
you're all done for.

00:53:37.020 --> 00:53:37.460
Ken!

00:53:53.210 --> 00:53:55.160
I was careless this time.

00:53:58.420 --> 00:53:59.680
But who would've thought

00:53:59.740 --> 00:54:01.210
that darn Nour was actually real.

00:54:03.940 --> 00:54:05.020
Hey, Inspector.

00:54:05.900 --> 00:54:07.300
You let your guard down too

00:54:07.300 --> 00:54:08.680
and let the suspect escape.

00:54:16.210 --> 00:54:17.060
Tell you what.

00:54:17.530 --> 00:54:19.060
I'll call headquarters

00:54:19.580 --> 00:54:20.650
so you can stay here.

00:54:22.040 --> 00:54:23.040
But

00:54:23.400 --> 00:54:25.280
I'll probably go back to Bangkok
for treatment.

00:54:27.770 --> 00:54:28.580
In this condition,

00:54:29.080 --> 00:54:30.500
I'd only hold you back.

00:54:31.770 --> 00:54:32.640
This time,

00:54:33.100 --> 00:54:34.770
I'll concede this one, James.

00:54:36.840 --> 00:54:38.060
But I also hope

00:54:38.540 --> 00:54:40.280
you'll catch the killer.

00:54:42.970 --> 00:54:43.780
Well,

00:54:44.090 --> 00:54:45.100
if there's nothing else,

00:54:45.970 --> 00:54:46.820
I'll get going.

00:54:46.900 --> 00:54:48.010
Wait, Little Roach.

00:54:53.600 --> 00:54:54.300
What?

00:54:57.890 --> 00:54:59.520
Give me Tee's passcode.

00:55:11.610 --> 00:55:12.780
Don't forget to send it.

00:55:13.010 --> 00:55:13.770
Mm.

00:55:21.330 --> 00:55:23.090
Am I the only one happy about this?

00:55:23.320 --> 00:55:24.560
I finally get to stay.

00:55:25.850 --> 00:55:27.050
You should transfer after all.

00:55:28.700 --> 00:55:30.000
Could you handle it

00:55:30.450 --> 00:55:31.730
being so far from me?

00:55:45.480 --> 00:55:47.170
Don't do anything dangerous again, okay?

00:55:48.260 --> 00:55:50.570
I hate patching you up every time.

00:55:51.740 --> 00:55:53.120
What can I do?

00:55:54.000 --> 00:55:55.860
My wounds don't heal like yours do.

00:55:57.720 --> 00:55:59.740
Then take better care of yourself.

00:56:11.680 --> 00:56:12.940
I'm sorry.

00:56:15.410 --> 00:56:16.250
I promise

00:56:17.500 --> 00:56:19.240
I won't get hurt again.

00:56:22.020 --> 00:56:23.530
You can trust me, Ken.

00:56:44.620 --> 00:56:45.820
Doctor, you should head home.

00:56:47.520 --> 00:56:48.960
See you tomorrow, Chita.

00:56:51.520 --> 00:56:52.210
See you tomorrow.

00:57:26.010 --> 00:57:34.200
♪Woo ooh ooh
woo ooh ooh ooh~♪

00:57:38.530 --> 00:57:41.890
♪How heavy the days were on my own♪

00:57:45.340 --> 00:57:48.890
♪My shoulders bore the unspoken load♪

00:57:51.420 --> 00:57:57.560
♪No time to weep, no chance to moan
I wore the weight♪

00:57:57.890 --> 00:57:59.560
♪like a stony robe♪

00:58:03.400 --> 00:58:09.500
♪The finest answers
fade like distant dreams♪

00:58:12.450 --> 00:58:16.720
♪Far away, beyond what eyes can see♪

00:58:18.970 --> 00:58:23.840
♪I dare not hope,
afraid dreams break apart♪

00:58:24.060 --> 00:58:29.860
♪Till tunes die down
and all the world departs♪

00:58:30.940 --> 00:58:34.690
♪How deep the scars
that life had carved♪

00:58:34.690 --> 00:58:38.170
♪How long the nights
where courage starved♪

00:58:38.170 --> 00:58:41.650
♪I walked this path,
through dust, through all♪

00:58:41.650 --> 00:58:46.130
♪Carried on, though strength would fall♪

00:58:46.130 --> 00:58:51.820
♪I viewed life plain without dismay
Cruel tales bring grief that won’t decay♪

00:58:51.820 --> 00:58:58.020
♪Don’t let me tread this lone pathway♪

00:59:26.080 --> 00:59:29.440
♪Till I met you, with scars the same♪

00:59:29.440 --> 00:59:33.050
♪After the grind of a sleepless frame♪

00:59:33.050 --> 00:59:39.760
♪We watched the sun paint skies anew
Maybe we’ll try, me and you♪

00:59:39.880 --> 00:59:43.320
♪How deep the scars
that life had carved♪

00:59:43.320 --> 00:59:46.610
♪How long the nights
where courage starved♪

00:59:46.610 --> 00:59:50.160
♪I walked this path,
through dust, through all♪

00:59:50.160 --> 00:59:53.100
♪Carried on, though strength would fall♪

00:59:53.160 --> 00:59:57.760
♪I viewed life plain without dismay♪

00:59:57.760 --> 01:00:00.450
♪Cruel tales bring grief
